{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202663NlEyfUHC1794614351.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美元匯價錄得兩個月以來，最大按星期升幅。</p><p></p><p>反映美元兌六隻主要貨幣的美匯指數，升百分之0.2至103.411，接近十九個月高位。全個星期計，升幅近百分之1.1。</p><p></p><p>美國近日公布的通脹數據偏高，推高加息預期，而美國總統特朗普日前又表示，不需要與伊朗達成協議，中東局勢轉趨緊張，美國債息上升，亦推動美元匯價向上。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.161930+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T23:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:33:37.303426+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:23.154863+00:00","content_hash":"63a7eb4d8a0b003818d6dd9234ef4d5dba2287a897d2f926402afc3d778809a8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}